  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Often times when I'm trying to use the movement controls with hand tracking on SteamVR, especially the turn left/right gesture, the rotation/alignment is incorrect making it difficult to control. Because the left/right joystick control is locked to only move along one axis, when this axis is wrong, I have to move my hand for example forwards and back to turn left and right. \n\nI think this is caused by either the FBT hip or the playspace \"forward\" direction being out of alignment with the player's head. My suggestion would be to always align the controls relative to the player's head, so that left and right are always actually left and actually right.",
